[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17941.59, "timestamp": "04:59:01", "text": "彼らに伝えて、人々に思い出させてください、そう、ジョー"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17944.788, "timestamp": "04:59:04", "text": "コラボ配信中なので、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17946.948, "timestamp": "04:59:06", "text": "メッセージやチャットに返信し、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17949.11, "timestamp": "04:59:09", "text": "すべてとその他諸々。またはあなたが"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17952.868, "timestamp": "04:59:12", "text": "YouTuber さん、フットペダルを買えばいいですよ、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17956.31, "timestamp": "04:59:16", "text": "Discord のスイッチを切り替えてください"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17958.948, "timestamp": "04:59:18", "text": "音声アクティビティからプッシュトゥトークへ。使用"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17963.19, "timestamp": "04:59:23", "text": "フットペダルで、プッシュトゥトークのように。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17965.91, "timestamp": "04:59:25", "text": "話すとき、えっと、押し下げる"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17968.39, "timestamp": "04:59:28", "text": "足でフットペダルを踏むと、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17971.11, "timestamp": "04:59:31", "text": "コラボレーターと話していますが、通話中または"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 17971.968, "timestamp": "04:59:31", "author": "@mattmeownster", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_k0PVo4Ayjzf9FlRcdjZAQYBwK430_hLvWlP9jgikQjC65W-ONDWjkk4dykteuHJ96HgQ=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "lmao foot pedal"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17972.948, "timestamp": "04:59:32", "text": "それ以外の場合は、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17974.708, "timestamp": "04:59:34", "text": "足はチャットで話すだけで、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17978.55, "timestamp": "04:59:38", "text": "マルチタスクをこなす。それが私の仕事です。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17980.47, "timestamp": "04:59:40", "text": "だから私はこのフットペダルを買ったんです"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 17986.392, "timestamp": "04:59:46", "author": "@mattmeownster", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_k0PVo4Ayjzf9FlRcdjZAQYBwK430_hLvWlP9jgikQjC65W-ONDWjkk4dykteuHJ96HgQ=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "dayyum"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17995.35, "timestamp